Package: PopGenR
Type: Package
Title: Population Genetics Statistics and Selection Scan Utilities
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Abu", "Bakar", email = "malikabubakar279@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Waqar", "ul Haq", role = "aut")
    )
Author: Abu Bakar [aut, cre],
    Waqar ul Haq [aut]
Maintainer: Abu Bakar <malikabubakar279@gmail.com>
Description: Provides utilities for population genetics workflows,
    including VCF parsing, allele-frequency summaries, nucleotide
    diversity, Watterson's theta, Tajima's D, pooled heterozygosity,
    linkage disequilibrium, PLINK-based quality control, and gene
    annotation of genomic regions or single positions.
